WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.450
Let’s walk through Tribe Street Journal.

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:06.037
Read or prepare reporting with its source context intact.

00:00:06.037 --> 00:00:09.925
Distinguish observation, selected quote, scenario reporting, and

00:00:09.925 --> 00:00:12.800
White Cell publication so participants can judge what kind of

00:00:12.800 --> 00:00:14.662
evidence they are receiving.

00:00:14.662 --> 00:00:18.175
On this slide, read scenario reporting, observations,

00:00:18.175 --> 00:00:20.188
moments, and selected quotes.

00:00:20.188 --> 00:00:22.975
In practice, use the journal as context and a

00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:24.475
prompt for discussion;

00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:27.163
it does not silently alter submitted work.

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.547
When you are ready, use Open Tribe Street Journal

00:00:30.547 --> 00:00:32.435
to move to the live surface.

00:00:32.435 --> 00:00:35.160
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:35.310
.
